  "steps": [
    "Marinate soya granules, veggies, some birista carrot with yogurt and spices and rest for 5 mins.",
    "Heat ghee in a heavy bottom pan. Add khada masalas, ginger-garlic paste and coriander-chilli puree.",
    "Add the marinated masala. Add water and covered for 10 mins.",
    "Meanwhile, soak shirataki rice in hot water for - few minutes, drain well. No cooking needed.",
    "Layer the soaked rice over the cooked masala. Top with birista.",
